{"symbol":"BHAGCHEM","yahoo":"BHAGCHEM.NS","bse":null,"isin":"INE414D01027","sme":null,"name":"Bhagiradha Chemicals & Industries Limited","sector":"Basic Materials","industry":"Agricultural Inputs","website":"https://www.bhagirad.com","about":"Bhagiradha Chemicals & Industries Limited manufactures and sells crop protection chemicals in India, rest of Asia, and Europe. The company offers insecticides, such as chlorpyrifos, chlorpyrifos-methyl, diafenthiuron, fipronil, dinotefuran, thiamethoxam, imidacloprid, pymetrozine, and chlorantraniliprole; fungicides, including azoxystrobin and trifloxystrobin; herbicides comprising triclopyr, cloquintocet-mexyl, clodinafop-propargyl, sulfosulfuron, and pinoxaden; and specialty intermediates consisting of 2,6-dichloroaniline and 2-ethylsulfonylimidazo pyridine-3-sulfonamide. It serves agrochemical manufacturers and pesticide formulators and traders. The company was incorporated in 1993 and is headquartered in Hyderabad, India.","updated":"2026-10-02T12:06:21+00:00","quote":{"price":238.5,"prevClose":238.55,"marketCap":3092.61,"high52":316.9,"low52":170.6,"pe":112.5,"bookValue":53.85,"dividendRate":0.15,"roe":null,"shares":12.9669,"insiders":63.43,"institutions":3.7},"prices":{"dates":["2021-10-18","2021-10-19","2021-10-20","2021-10-21","2021-10-22","2021-10-25","2021-10-26","2021-10-27","2021-10-28","2021-10-29","2021-11-01","2021-11-02","2021-11-03","2021-11-04","2021-11-08","2021-11-09","2021-11-10","2021-11-11","2021-11-12","2021-11-15","2021-11-16","2021-11-17","2021-11-18","2021-11-22","2021-11-23","2021-11-24","2021-11-25","2021-11-26","2021-11-29","2021-11-30","2021-12-01","2021-12-02","2021-12-03","2021-12-06","2021-12-07","2021-12-08","2021-12-09","2021-12-10","2021-12-13","2021-12-14","2021-12-15","2021-12-16","2021-12-17","2021-12-20","2021-12-21","2021-12-22","2021-12-23","2021-12-24","2021-12-27","2021-12-28","2021-12-29","2021-12-30","2021-12-31","2022-01-03","2022-01-04","2022-01-05","2022-01-06","2022-01-07","20